  triage:promoteTo <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAG-s25/c245c2ea> ;
  triage:notes "Followup pass: AG.21 QA report (PR #580, commit bf96dc86) confirms daemon-layer fork dispatch consolidation complete (SendRequestRoute::Remote branch now uses classify_remote_send_delivery_outcome for centralized outcome handling), but function-level fork persists: build_remote_deferred_outcome remains separate from any hypothetical local-path equivalent outcome builder. AG.18-AG.20 had both forks open. AG.21 fixed daemon-layer fork, function-level fork remains open. AG.22-AG.25 branch from AG.21 baseline after merge-forward and inherit function-level fork (fixed_partial state). Next action: Fix AG.22+ via merge-forward closure pattern, or dispatch new AG26 sprint to consolidate function-level fork if within phase scope." .

